{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>DayFlow Planner 是一款專為現代人設計的綜合型日程規劃工具，適合需要整合任務、提醒事項及用藥追蹤的用戶使用。該 App 目前提供限時免費下載，幫助使用者以更直觀的方式掌控日常生活節奏，無需支付原本高昂的訂閱費用即可體驗其核心功能。</p>\n\n<h2>智能提醒與多維度管理</h2>\n<p>此應用具備任務管理、智能提醒、用藥追蹤及支出記錄等多種實用功能。介面設計簡潔現代，支援無限次排程設定與安全備份還原，讓用戶能輕鬆整理日常瑣事。透過整合這些關鍵資訊於單一平台，有效減少切換不同軟體的時間成本，提升生活效率與條理性。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-663-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-664-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-665-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-666-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-667-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-668-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：DayFlow Planner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T01:59:27.442489+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}